<#ff5a50>BACKLACE AMMO</>
Reload		^X
  Backlace holds 6 rounds (bottom of the screen). Gun
  specials use them; out of rounds they come out as a
  short pistol-whip instead. Quick, but she can be hit
  out of it.
Quick-draw Reload		_D^X
  Slower and riskier. Reloads, and the next gun special
  fires one extra bullet (she glows while it's ready).

<#ff5a50>SYSTEM</>
Parry		^Z
  Catches any attack. A whiff costs 80 meter and leaves her
  open.
Grab (air too)		^Y
Burst (while being hit)		^A_+^B_+^C
  Invincible, no damage, hard knockdown. 75 second cooldown.
Super Jump		_D_U

<#ff5a50>NORMALS</>
Light / Medium / Heavy		^A ^B ^C
Standing Light Kick		_F^A
Crouching Light Kick		_DF^A
Air Light Kick (in the air)		_F^A

<#ff5a50>SPECIALS</>
Backlace (air too, 1 round)		_D_DF_F^A/^B
Backlace Anti-air (1 round)		_F_D_DF^A/^B
Rapid Fire (500 meter, 2 rounds)		_D_DF_F^C
Rapid Fire Anti-air (500, 2 rounds)		_F_D_DF^C
Rolling Stone (1 round)		_B(hold)_F^A/^B
Cosmo's Pole (overhead)		_D_DB_B^A/^B
Random Pole Dance (counter)		_F_DF_D_DB_B^A/^B

<#ff5a50>SUPERS</>
Double Backlace (1 bar)		_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^A_+^B
Bangin' Up (1 bar, grab)		_D_DB_B_D_DB_B^A_+^B
5T-R1P3 (2 bars)		_F_DF_D_DB_B_F^A_+^B
Briefers 69 (2 bars)		_D_DB_B_D_DF_F^A_+^B
FLY AWAY NOW (3, low life)		_D_DF_F_D_DB_B^A_+^B
Minigun (3 bars)		_F_B_DB_D_DF_F^C
  Any two of A/B/C work for the two-button supers.
  Supers don't use rounds.
